window.products.push({"id":1023005,"name":"CafePress Well Behaved Women Rarely Make History Tote Bag Natural Canvas Tote Bag, Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ss1HxEiML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Your New Favorite Bag: Make a statement with a fun and functional canvas tote bag that shows off your unique personality. This versatile, multipurpose classic is sure to become your go-to reusable, foldable bag that is perfect for shopping, work, or vacation. Two Sizes: Small tote measures 15\" x 15 x 6\" with 26.5\" handles. Medium tote measures 15\" x 18\" x 6\" with 22\" handles. Each tote size features reinforced handles and full side and bottom support gussets for strength and durability. Professionally Printed: Our tote bags are imported from our trusted partners. Then each tote is expertly printed with sharp and vivid graphics using premium inks by our USA printing partner. Our quality totes are built to last: construction, design and graphic design placement. Easy To Care For Eco-Friendly Carryall Option: No need to use more plastic grocery bags, wasteful wrapping paper or other one time use products. Use for everyday errands, to present gifts, stow away items and organize with our minimalist tote bags. Once our cotton canvas bags become soiled, simply spot clean or place in washing machine on your favorite cold setting. Machine dry on low heat or hang dry. Ideal Everyday Tote or Gift : Treat yourself or surprise family members, friends, colleagues or your favorite teacher. Our beautifully designed cotton canvas tote bags make a unique and thoughtful present for Christmas, Easter, Mother's Day, birthdays, back-to-school, weddings, anniversary and so much more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ss1HxEiML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CafePress","source_asin":"B0BHZ871B7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHZ871B7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHZ871B7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023006,"name":"KARIN DREAMS Cooling Blanket, Lightweight Comforter Set, All Season Comforter, Soft & Machine Washable Cool Blankets for Hot Sleepers, Queen (86\"x86\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VipMFZ+bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All Season Comforter: The proper thickness quilt makes you don't feel hot in summer and keeps you warm in cold winter, offers a just-right feel that suits the average sleeper. The lightweight comforter is not too heavy to pressure you, allowing you to sleep comfortably all night. Simple but elegant design matches perfectly various styles, refreshes your bedroom Double Sided Design: The back side is made of 60% PE cooling fiber and 40% nylon which has a cool and silky feeling; Top side is made of 60% nylon and 40% yarn-dyed microfiber which has soft and breathable touch. The lightweight comforter filling is made of whole piece silky microfiber which is better for machine washable, also making the quilt more soft and durable Choose Your Ideal Size: Throw comforter set (50x60\") without pillow sham, Twin comforter set (66x86\") with 1 Standard (20X26\") pillow sham, Full/Queen comforter set (86X86\") with 2 Standard (20X26\") pillow shams, King comforter set (102X86\") with 2 King (20X36\") pillow shams Widely use: Small size lightweight comforter can be used for single beds, camping, sofas as well as in the car and office. Queen and King size comforters can be used at home for families. Comes with a roll rope bag which is better for storage and carry Clean & Care: The comforter is machine washable directly with warm water. We suggest washing with a laundry bag to prevent entanglement and damage and air dry the quilt after unsealing the bag to maintain the plumpness","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VipMFZ+bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KARIN DREAMS","source_asin":"B09333S3SS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09333S3SS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09333S3SS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
