window.products.push({"id":1023026,"name":"Bamboo Bread Box + Wood Cutting Board - Food Storage - Non Toxic - Eco Friendly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4AB1O3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why put up with metal bread boxes that dent and rust, or those with moving parts that bind and break? Our Holt & Oden Bread Box set provides superior quality and value to similar products because: - Our bread box with its built-in cutting board, is convenient, simply elegant and will stand the test of time. - The bread box and lid have no moving parts to bind or break, no metal to dent or rust. - The bamboo bread box is made of eco-friendly, non-toxic bamboo fiber that is biodegradable and incredibly strong. - This bread keeper naturally keeps bread storage and other baked goods fresh longer, increasing the value of your grocery shopping and home baking. - The bamboo cutting board or serving tray features attractive crumb catcher grooves to keep your counter top and table clean. - You can clean the bread bin in the dishwasher – it will never break, rust or warp! The lid is easily hand washed and dried. - This bread basket won’t take much space on your counter – leaving more room in the cupboard and pantry. - Our bread container is also cleverly used for crafts, make-up and jewelry, the crumb grooves keeping beads and accessories organized. We have a no hassle 100% guarantee refund policy. If you do not love your Holt & Oden Bread Box, simply return for a full refund, no questions asked. Who do you know that would also love this bread box? Add another one to your cart as a gift!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71i4AB1O3TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holt & Oden","source_asin":"B074PM85PX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023026","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074PM85PX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074PM85PX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023027,"name":"Uniques Addict Store\" Seahorse Collectible Art Glass Blown Animal Figurine Handmade Sea Horse Art Glass Blown Sea Animal Figurine Glass Handblown Fish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714eqedSomL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💎 Professional Handmade Glass Blown Collectible Sea Animal Figurine Handcraft 💎 Pufferfish, also known as blowfish or swellfish, noted for their ability to inflate themselves so greatly with air or water when disturbed. That turns them into a virtually inedible ball several times to their normal size. Almost all puffer fish species contain tetrodotoxin which makes them foul tasting and often lethal to fish, humans. You can have this special kind of fish for your marine collection with our premium quality handmade glass fish figurine ! Our glass blown puffer fish figurine is made of high quality and beautiful texture borosilicate glass material. It is a unique product of highly experienced and detailed handmade and imagination process. During creation of our glass art, very high temperatures are used to get special melted glass material. Then modeling and coloring is applied to get unique design for only you. And glass blowing is applied by our skillful hands to create this charming artwork. 👑 Premium Quality and Unique Design Sea Animal Glass Art 👑 🐡 High quality and beautiful texture glass 🐡 Can stand for long time with natural use 🐡 Easy to clean and not easily stain texture 🐡 Professional handmade glass sculpture art 🐡 Perfect and glamorous gift option for your family and friends 🐡 Perfect gift for many occasions like birthday, greetings, weddings etc. 🐡 Will give you natural marine atmosphere 🐡 Unique home, office, room, workspace décor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714eqedSomL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uniques Addict","source_asin":"B09FGM66SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FGM66SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FGM66SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023028,"name":"Fiesta 10-1/2-Inch Dinner Plate, Tangerine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815s8Hk45sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Fiesta 10-1/2-Inch Dinner Plate manufactured by The Homer Laughlin China Company. America's largest domestic producer of dinnerware, and the sole manufacturer of all Fiesta dinnerware. All Fiesta pieces are Microwave safe, Oven-proof, Dishwasher safe, Freezerproof, Lead-Free, and Made in America with the implementation of many green practices. The very durable glaze is great for everyday use. Fiesta as a pattern has stood the test of time, and is typically passed down from one generation to the next. We have kept the pattern constant through the years so that you can count on us to be here when you decide to expand or change your collection. New pieces and colors are added every so often to keep things interesting. Currently, Fiesta is the most collected dinnerware in America. Amazon.com First introduced in 1936 by the Homer Laughlin China Company and reissued in 1986 to mark the 50th anniversary of the line, colorful Fiestaware has been a collectable dinnerware favorite for generations. While original Fiestaware can fetch prices as high as $6,000 for a rare piece in a rare color, new Fiestaware is affordable, features the same great styling as the originals, and, unlike older pieces, has a 100 percent lead-free glaze. With the signature Fiestaware concentric rings around the plate rim, this plate complements other Fiestaware dinnerware and accessories. The glaze is nonporous and durable, but some stainless-steel flatware may leave marks on the plate. These marks can be removed with a nonabrasive cleanser. --Emily Wolf","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815s8Hk45sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homer Laughlin","source_asin":"B00KU2MPVK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KU2MPVK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KU2MPVK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
