window.products.push({"id":1023080,"name":"Rends Portable Handheld Vacuum, 8000PA Cordless Hand Vacuum with Wooden Floor Brush, Rechargeable Dry Handheld Vacuum Cleaner for Pet Hair, Dust, Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnoQgIB0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8Kpa Powerful Cyclonic Suction - Cleaning up is a breeze! RENDS handheld vacuum cordless powered by lithium technology which provides strong suction up to 8Kpa. This portable vacuum utilizes a super-strong power motor with fade-free power. We aim to provide all-around protection for all the corners of your home and car, such as suck out daily pet hair, cat litter, paper debris, and crumbs, etc. Quick Charge & Long Cleaning Time - With 2200mah high-capacity Lithium batteries, this handheld cordless rechargeable vacuum can be fully charged in 3-4 hours with a working time of up to 30 minutes. At the same time, this hand vacuum goes with a 600ml large-capacity dust collection cup to meet the need for deep cleaning dirty needs from your kitchen, living room to the bedroom. Cordless Design & Upgraded Hepa Filter - This cordless rechargeable hand vacuum is lightweight and portable to help you clean everywhere easily without bulky and tangled cords. It features a HEPA filter which is exquisite workmanship with long durability and can be washed to clean dirties. Mult-Accessories & All-Round Cleaning - RENDS hand vacuum With 4 different types of attachments. The extra-long crevice tool cleans hard-to-reach areas with less effort and the brush tool for upholstery. The rubber jar attachment can even make it suck up to 100ml of liquid each time. The floor brush tool cleans your wooden floor (Please note that the floor brush can't clean the carpet) Multiple Protections & Portable Design - The RENDS Handheld Vacuum has temperature protection, input voltage protection, input current protection, and short circuit protection better ensure equipment safety throughout the charging process. The translucent, bagless dirt bowl makes it easy to see the dirt level and is easy to empty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cnoQgIB0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rends","source_asin":"B08QRST16M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QRST16M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QRST16M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
