window.products.push({"id":1023106,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Leggett & Platt Grenada Headboard, Cocoa Walnut/Charcoal, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yJSBmu7iL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Grenada headboard looks like it was taken right out of a centuries-old spice plantation. This mixed media, wood and metal headboard has remarkably classic lines. Two 2-5/8-Inch solid, hardwood posts are topped with hand-poured, cast end caps. The camelback grills are welded for added stability. The dramatic scrolls within the grills are cleverly wrapped with metal ties. Each inner scroll is finished with a delicate process with results in a flat hammered end; giving the appearance of a genuinely, hand made piece. One single arrow-straight, hammered tube marks the center of the bed. Two single loops wrap around each post connecting together with the grill; hugging metal to wood. You don’t have to go far to find the inspiration for the distinctive finish of the mixed media Grenada bed. The hardwood posts are finished in a beautiful Cocoa Walnut; a darker chocolate brown color. The grill features a plated Charcoal finish; best described as basic matte silver with a black patina appearance dulling the silver creating an aged outcome. The finish is lacquered for durability and ease-of-care for generations to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yJSBmu7iL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B002HWRE2Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023106","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002HWRE2Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002HWRE2Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
