window.products.push({"id":1023113,"name":"Oauxy Adjustable Foldable Air Conditioner Deflector, Anti-Direct Blowing Baffle Windshield for Home, Mini-Split, Central A/C Units for Home Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FdmxbyZsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description Adjustable: suitable for all seasons. The arm of our deflector can be adjusted freely to change the wind direction of the air conditioner. It is convenient to enjoy cool and warm air in summer and winter respectively There are multi-layer filters on the left and right sides of the air deflector to filter out formaldehyde, peculiar smells and harmful gases in the air without letting go of every fine dust. Rubber vibration with reliable damping capacity can absorb shock and keep the correct distance from the wall to achieve air flow Deflection of uncomfortable blowing, even to make temperature uniform, improve the efficiency of the air conditioner at 2 degrees Fahrenheit (* 1) Lightweight installation and versatility-very easy to assemble, including all necessary hardware, no tools required Products include 1x air conditioning baffle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FdmxbyZsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oauxy","source_asin":"B096RKVP8V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096RKVP8V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096RKVP8V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023114,"name":"Samantha Fish Decal, Blues Guitar Fish Sticker (H 2.5 by L 7 Inches, Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VsYr2AkxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These Materials are needed to install your decal on almost any clean and flat surface, such as a windshield, laptop, wall, or other smooth surface with simple curves : Water, Paper Towel/Rag, Credit Card/Drivers License, and Scotch tape. Before installing your decal, remove any air bubbles that may have formed from temperature changes during shipping by taking your decal into a cooled environment, then use a credit/debit card to smooth out your decal until most, or all of the air bubbles disappear. Then, clean your desired surface with WATER ONLY. (Do Not Use soap or other cleaners. The adhesive from your decal may have a hard time sticking to them.) After cleaning your surface, tape a piece of scotch tape horizontally to the top of your decal. Then, stick your decal to your clean surface. Now that your decal sticks to your surface, flip it up so that you see the back of your decal. Then, peel your clear transfer tape away from the backing until you can pull the backing away from the scotch tape. Then, with a credit card, start from the top of your decal image and apply it to your clean surface. Please wait 3 to 5 minutes for your decal to adhere. Then, slowly peel off the clear transfer tape until the only thing sticking to your surface is your decal image. (If your decal image starts coming off as you peel away your clear transfer tape, stop peeling and squeegee your decal with a credit card. Repeat this process until your decal sticks.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VsYr2AkxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dan's Decals","source_asin":"B07L3BDC5F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023114","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L3BDC5F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L3BDC5F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
