window.products.push({"id":1023217,"name":"Non slip rug grippers for carpet, 16 pcs grippers for rugs, Stops Rug from curling /slipping, double sided anti curling non slip reusable rug pad, kee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A48Zp8GBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Now no worries of rug corner curling. This gripper is made of high quality rubber which makes it anti slip. The shape of this tape is designed in such a way that it can be used with all types and shapes of rug and carpet. It can be used in corner, edge and circular shape of rugs. It can be used for any hard floors, such as wooden, marble, tile, laminate, linoleum floors. Just follow the simple instructions to apply and then enjoy your activities on rugs without worry of curling or slipping. 16 pieces of these tapes can be used in more than 1 rug depending on the size of rug. By using this anti slip tape you can make your family safe. One side to Carpet: You need to peel off its backing and then stick to underside of rug then press firmly. Other Side to Floor: Peel of backing and adheres to floor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61A48Zp8GBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B0BDVPB6WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDVPB6WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDVPB6WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
