window.products.push({"id":1023293,"name":"Wine Glasses Set of 6, Long Stem Red & White Crystal Wine Glasses that Hold a Bottle of Wine 17 OZ, Edge Wine Glasses for Burgundy Cabernet with Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615FsK-xYrL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"[BEAUTIFUL CRYSTAL WINE GLASSES SET OF 6] Wet finger along the rim of this very nice crystal wine glasses, an age old sign of quality hand blown crystal. The Bordeaux glasses were the right size to compliment either red or white it provided the right \"\"nose \"\" to intake the full effervescence of the wine. The rim thickness is just right, the goblet is light, classy, even makes the wine tase better. [17 OZ RED WINE GLASSES SET of 6] If you're looking for style, elegance, usability, and just an all around beautiful wine glass then these are for you. These wine glasses are very classy, 100% hand blown, and surprisingly versatile - from Chardonnay to Pinot Noir. These would be a great gift, or a great replacement if you're looking for new matching wine glasses. [Elegant Wine Experience]: Our wine glasses have a crystal-grade clarity with non-porous and smooth touch, after swishing and swirling your wine with ease, you will feel elegant in hand and on the lip so that elevate your wine experience. They are thin but sturdy, so that you can safely put them in your dishwasher and use them comfortably without hesitation! [NICE GIFT FOR FRIENDS AND FAMILYS AND YOURSELF] Your friends and familys would love the way they feel (soooo light) and they sound great when giving a toast. Come with colorful gift box, purchase them as a gift to your mom for mother's day, as a bridal shower gift, as a housewarming/birthday gift for your friends, as the best wine glasses in your collection. Nice everyday wine glasses set of 6. [DURABLE GOBLETS AND PERFECT WRAPPING] Reducing the possible to break by the time they reach destination because they are enclosed in foam, and the gift box is also sturdy. Light, hand-made and classy, Dishwasher safe. Enjoy using the glasses and came in a great package. If there is any dissatisfaction about the wine glasses, please feel free to contact us, we will always stand behind you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615FsK-xYrL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gracefulhat","source_asin":"B07T3BR43K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T3BR43K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T3BR43K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
