window.products.push({"id":1023316,"name":"Keweis Bento Box Adult Lunch Box Set, Portable Insulated Lunch Containers with Thermal Bag, Stackable Stainless Steel Leakproof Food Container for Adu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q1coqLWlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Food Grade Material】Keweis lunch box set is made of high quality food-grade safe PP plastic (external) and durable 304 stainless steel (internal), BPA free, No rust, no odor retention, so you can use it without any worries. HEALTH AND SAFETY, Unique design, fresh and elegant style, perfect for aldults, kids, women and men. 【KEEP FOOD WARM】The stainless steel bottom of the inner layer of the thermal lunch box is designed with PU foam filling, which keeps the heat preservation longer and can provide 3-4 hours of heat preservation effect. Before use, it is recommended to wet the inside and outside of the bento box with hot water to preheat. After the food is cooked, it is recommended to put it into the bento lunch box immediately, and then put it into the insulated bag (don't wait for all the bento box to be packed) 【Lunch Box Set 】You will get 4 Insulated bento lunch boxes - two sizes, two large and two small, to meet your different needs. SMALL(14.2OZ/420ml), LARGE (20.1OZ/620ml). With an insulated lunch bag, enhanced insulation, it is very convenient to carry out. Convenient for you to enjoy tasty homemade food at school or at work or going out. Great for store soups, fried rice, pasta or other hot food; can also be used to store cold food such as salads, fruits and more. 【Leak-proof & Convenient Design】Each bento lunch box comes with a double silicone seal to lock in freshness, leaks and odors. There is a clamshell exhaust valve on the top of the lid, the hot air can be exhausted at any time, which makes it easier to open the lunch box; there is a handle on the top of the lid, which is convenient to carry and move, and can be reset after use.The lunch box with double heat insulation layer design allows you to enjoy food at any time, No hot feeling in hand. 【Free Combination 】The stainless steel Insulated lunch box set adopts a Stackable design, which can be freely combined and stored separately, preserving the original flavor of the food and making life more pleasant and refined. 2 sizes for easy storage of different foods, great for kids going to school, adults working, exercising, camping and traveling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Q1coqLWlL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keweis","source_asin":"B0B3XVSCPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XVSCPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XVSCPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023317,"name":"Cuisinart CPB-300PK SmartPower 15-Piece Compact Portable Blending/Chopping System, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71el4Xre6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet the Cuisinart SmartPower Compact Portable Blender - the compact powerhouse that does it all! Use the streamline blending cup to make smoothies in a flash! Mince herbs in the chopper cup and whip up custom drinks right in the \"To-Go\" cups - we've included four of them so everyone can have their favorite! Designed of fit anywhere, the Compact Portable Blender delivers big blender performance with a 350 watt motor and the ease of a single hand operation with the user friendly electronic key pad! Stainless steel accents create an attractive, fashionable addition to any kitchen. New BPA free Tritan from Eastman co-polyestor is used for all the vessels - blender, chopper and your \"To-Go\" cups. They are all shatter resistant and dishwasher safe. A real timer saver, clean up and maintenance become simple chores.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71el4Xre6wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B00CDTLQEA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CDTLQEA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CDTLQEA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
