window.products.push({"id":1023340,"name":"Popsicle Bags with Funnel - 5 Pcs Disposable Freeze Pop Molds, Zip Sealed Popsicle Pouch Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oeoqCfPHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It's Time to Make Better Snack Choices for You and Your Family with Our MEDca Popsicle Bags and Funnel Set! Are you worried about your kids' snacking habits? Do you know how much sugar, calories, and preservatives are in your kid's snacks? Are you concerned about how much they are consuming? Gain peace of mind when you start making these snacks at home with our Disposable Popsicle Bags. With 5 Popsicle Bags you can easily make what's best for your kids while they help you prepare their favorite snacks. Make squeezable smoothies with yogurt and fruits or freeze into popsicles for later. Plus, they're not just for kids. Adults can join in the fun by making popsicles with their favorite juices and mixes. Everyone gets to enjoy fun and healthy homemade snacks! With Homemade Ice Pops the Flavors are Endless! Mix juices, fruits, and even veggies to make more healthful popsicles. Combine yogurt or coconut milk with fruits for smoothies. You can even make toddler-approved pops by pureeing fruits and veggies Another benefit of making snacks at home is you can get your kids to participate so they know what they're eating and will feel proud that they made it themselves. Make them on the weekends so you'll have a week's supply of snacks readily available in the freezer for in-between meals. Or for you to grab in the morning before you go to work. KEY PRODUCT FEATURES: Includes - 5 Disposable Ice Pop Bags Includes - 5 Disposable Ice Pop Bags Bags Measure: 11 in x 2 in | Holds 4 fl oz Bags Measure: 11 in x 2 in | Holds 4 fl oz Premium Quality Construction Premium Quality Construction 1 - Silicone Funnel 1 - Silicone Funnel Air-tight Secure Zip Seal Air-tight Secure Zip Seal Easy to Read Fill Line Indicator Easy to Read Fill Line Indicator Easy Tear Notch Easy Tear Notch Why Wait!? Click \"Add to Cart\" to order your Bulk Value Pack of Disposable Popsicle Bags today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oeoqCfPHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MEDca","source_asin":"B08HR3BJ2F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HR3BJ2F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HR3BJ2F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
