window.products.push({"id":1023373,"name":"BTF-LIGHTING WS2812B RGB IC Individually Addressable Chasing Color Smart Fairy String Light PVC Wire 16.4FT 50LEDs DC5V for Twinkle Decorative Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V2ykPREhL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"FANTASTIC COLOR CHANGING: Designed with 50 LEDs.WS2812B IC Chip .Individually addressable .There are countless kinds of effects, the type of effect depends on which controller you use. Perfect for indoor decoration, party and wedding, ideal decoration for Christmas and New Year. Bring romantic and joyful ambiance to your space just in few seconds! DC5V1A 5W For 50LEDs.Technology upgrade.Unlike ordinary LED fairy strings, this string is WS2812B RGB LED chip that can be programmed to work with different controllers. Many light strings on the market only change in monochrome. This product can achieve the chasing color effects. Every LED can be different color. High Quality.This 16.4ft/5m fairy lights with premium quality . Fairy lights can be cut off, LED string light still working after it is cut. Can be connected in series,Used to decorate larger projects, 4 strings in series, there can be 64ft long 200LEDs. Different lengths can be connected in series for different needs ,like rainbow,fire,chasing color etc Support ALL The WS2812B DC5V Controller. Work with SP110E SP608E SP611E SP105E SP107E SP108E SP601E SP106E SP501E CSY07 CSY08 X2 , WiFi ,Bluetooth ,APP ,Remote ,Musical etc Controllers . Working Voltage DC5V . Do not use DC12V power supply . Power supply or Controller is not included . You can also use your own DIY controller like R3 ,Raspi,ESP8266 etc IP65 Waterproof Copper Wire: The copper wire light is sealed completely whose waterproof rating is IP65.Easy to Shape: The outdoor string light is made of soft copper wire that can be easily bent and molded in potted plant, bed, display case, wall, ceiling, window, Christmas tree and many other places. Becoming a designer in your life is something to look forward to! 【Don't light up full white light】The LEDs at the far end of the string might be Red Orange light because of the added resistance and voltage drop that occurs as the current flows to that end of the string.This is a normal physical phenomenon, and all the LED strip cannot avoid this problem.Adding DC5V voltage can solve this problem","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61V2ykPREhL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BTF-LIGHTING","source_asin":"B0B4W4F2ZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4W4F2ZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4W4F2ZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
