window.products.push({"id":1023453,"name":"BLISSBURY Adjustable Water Pillow ~ Waterbase and fiberfill Stuffing Adjust to Help Side Sleepers with Shoulder or Neck Pain. Complimentary Bamboo Pil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JkwtEEVYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEVER COMPROMISE SLEEP AGAIN:​​ ​ Why make concessions for ​sleeping​ when you can achieve the perfect ​elevation​ and ​comfort ​to meet your preference?​ ​The Blissburry SpineRight e​rgonomic pillow​ adapts to your sleeping needs, not the other way around. With one layer inflated with water and the other layer comprised of microfiber, you can change the ​firmness​ and ​height ​of your​ cushion​. FINALLY, A GOOD NIGHT’S REST: ​​Our ​comfortable sleep pillows​ not only exude ​plushness and​ elegance​ - they guarantee​ superior sleeping conditions​ ​for uninterrupted, deep sleep​. These waterbase pillows​ allow you to put your​ neck, head, and spine​ at an optimal angle that ensures proper breathing and airflow​. The SpineRight pillow ensures the ​best ​quality of sleep you can have. SAY GOODBYE TO ​​NECK PAIN​​ AND ​​DISCOMFORT:​​ ​​Wake up feeling ​refreshed, ​sans typical ​aches​ and ​creeks ​that often result from old age, past injuries, or just poor sleeping patterns. Our ​comfy​, ​plush ​neck support pillows​ are perfect for ​back sleepers, side sleepers​, ​pregnant women​, the ​elderly​, or those who suffer from ​broken sleep ​and/or ​snoring​. It’s even great for ​stomach sleepers and ​children​. UNLIKE ANYTHING ON THE MARKET: ​​You won’t find a more ​unique pillow​ or ​cushion​ like the Blissburry SpineRight​ bed accessory​. Not only is this​ bed pillow ​equipped with a compartment where you can add water for added texture and support - you can also remove the stuffing from the other compartment based on what angle you want your neck to be. Built with dual layers, our versatile pillows​ are the only ones that have an ​adjustable​ top layer filling and a bottom layer of water. GORGEOUS STYLE​​, SIMPLE CARE: ​​Made of​ bamboo and polyester​, our ​elevation pillows mold gently to the contours of your body, ​creating an inviting and​ ​luxurious, ergonomic feel​. The outer layer is boasts a ​quilted, soft grey aesthetic​ and is ​removable ​and ​machine washable ​for ​easy care​. Ideal for ​men​ and ​women ​alike, these ​high-quality​ ​bedding accessories​ are ​stylish​ enough to make fantastic ​gift sets for Christmas, birthdays, graduations, Valentine’s Day or weddings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JkwtEEVYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLISSBURY","source_asin":"B07G9YG354","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023453","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07G9YG354","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07G9YG354","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
