window.products.push({"id":1023481,"name":"JOYIN 96 Halloween Drawstring Treat Bags 6\"x6\" for Kids; Plastic Trick or Treat Candy Goody Bags for Kids Halloween Party Favor Supplies, Classroom Go","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-2kO8AujL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER VALUE PACK. Our Halloween bag includes 96 pcs of Plastic Drawstring Treat Bag with 12 designs. These measures 6x6 inches each. Halloween characters, interactive background & color designs. The designs are Spider, Frankenstein, Tombstone, Bat,Pumpkin head, Skeleton, Ghost and Two Halloween caption designs. Colorful & vivid Halloween themed character expression design. UNIQUE DESIGN & EASY TO USE. Why not pack your Halloween goody bags to hand out instead of a huge bucket of candy and let the youngsters help themselves? And the youngsters will adore them since they will be able to unwrap their food like a real present. These bags are less scary and more welcoming, making them excellent for younger children. These snack packs are guaranteed to be a favorite on All Hallows Eve, thanks to their adorable Halloween design! ENDLESS FUN. These can be used for Halloween Bags, Halloween Goodie Bags, Halloween Candy Bags, Halloween Treat Bags, Halloween Trick or Treat Bags, Halloween Party Favor Bags, Halloween Gift Bags, Halloween Snack Goody Bags, and other occasions. PREMIUM QUALITY. Child Safe: Non-Toxic. Meet US toy standards. Safety test approved. CUSTOMER SATISFACTION. Providing a 100% satisfaction experience is our main priority to our customers. Feel free to message us through “contact sellers” if products don’t meet your expectations. The celebrations start at JOYIN!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-2kO8AujL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYIN","source_asin":"B0989DNWPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0989DNWPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0989DNWPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023482,"name":"Hot Cocoa and Netflix Binging Funny Coffee Mug | Microwave Dishwasher Safe Holiday Ceramic Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tz-R1ACxL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hot Cocoa and Netflix Binging Kinda Day Funny Coffee Mug FOXY MUG mugs are custom created in our studio in beautiful Newport Beach, California. Our mugs are designed, produced and packaged by us and we take great pride in our products.  Our designs are permanently sublimated onto our mugs, NO vinyl or stickers are used  Our mugs are microwave and dishwasher safe and lead free  We securely package our mugs in special boxes to protect from damage during shipping  The design is printed on both sides of the mug which makes it a great option for left or right handed use Why choose FOXY MUG? We are happy to say we do not use any third party printers or mass manufacturers to make our mugs. All of our mugs are designed, printed and sublimated by us in our studio, using the highest quality sublimation inks and materials.   We have been in business since 2014 with thousands of satisfied customers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Tz-R1ACxL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foxy Mug","source_asin":"B07JFHBFS6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JFHBFS6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JFHBFS6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023483,"name":"WENNEBIRD Model B Lumbar Support Pillow - Enhance Posture During Sitting - Memory Foam and Ergonomic Design for Office, Car, Gaming, Couch, Recliner -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P3uZUclDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ergonomic Design: The Model B lumbar support pillow features an ergonomic contoured design. Its butterfly thickened design on the sides effectively relieves pressure on the buttocks' sides when seated. It is particularly suitable for filling the gap between the lower back waist and the seat's left and right sides, providing essential lumbar support for comfortable sitting. The ergonomic design ensures optimal support and comfort for your back. Luxury Fabric Design: The Model B lumbar support pillow with Alcantara fabric, known for its delicate texture and softness. The black color is inspired by the deep serenity of gazing out into the vastness of the universe in the Apollo Lunar Module, creating a visually pleasing aesthetic. The pillow cover is equipped with a zipper on the back, allowing for easy removal and making it machine-washable or suitable for hand-washing. Keep the pillow clean and fresh with minimal effort. Dynamically Memory Foam: Made of 50D density memory foam. It is pressure-sensitive, redistributes weight, and adjusts to your body's shape and warmth, gradually conforming to provide a customized fit. It evenly distributes pressure on the lumbar and back, maintaining the natural curve of your lower back. This memory foam is highly durable and resilient, retaining its shape and support over time, ensuring long-lasting effectiveness. Multipurpose Design: The lumbar support makes it perfect for a range of applications. With dimensions of 16.1×4.3× 8.3 inches and weighing just 1pounds, it is lightweight and portable. Whether you require support while working in the office, relaxing in a recliner, driving on road trips, or sitting on plane seats during flights, this cushion is ideal. It can also be added to a wheelchair for added comfort, and gamers will appreciate the extra support it provides when using gaming seats. Certified Safe Materials: As part of our dedication to delivering high-quality products, the product has undergone rigorous testing and certification. It has been tested according to EU EN71-1, EN71-2, and EN71-3 standards and has obtained the CE mark. Additionally, it complies with the stringent California Proposition 65 standards. This means that every component of our lumbar support pillow is certified safe and free from harmful substances, ensuring it is harmless to human health.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P3uZUclDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WENNEBIRD","source_asin":"B08XVZ49WD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XVZ49WD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XVZ49WD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
