window.products.push({"id":1023537,"name":"Avvexa Towel Robes for Women, Spa Body Wrap with Hair Wrap & Tote, 100% Turkish Cotton Towel Wraps for Women with Velcro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91t29doJIaL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Turkish Cotton Machine Wash PREMIUM QUALITY: These OEKO-TEX-certified practical yet dressy towel robes for women are free from harmful substances and are made of 100% original pure Turkish Cotton. These spa robes for women are sewn together from a special and traditional towel cloth named peshtemal, which is reputable for its lightweight, quick dry, and super absorbent texture. It has conveniently been used within the Classic Turkish Bathhouse (Hamam) and Spa wrap context for hundreds of years THOUGHTFUL DESIGN: Our body wrap set perfectly functions as bath robes for women after shower and offer great privacy after a shower or spa session. Our authentic patterned colorful towel dress comes with a large matching chic tote bag and a hair wrap, also sewn up from unique Turkish Peshtemal Towel cloth WRAP TOWEL WITH VELCRO: This elegantly made wrap towel with velcro for women features elastic bands that wraparound your body for a snug, secure and comfortable fit. Adjustable velcro closure makes this shower wrap adjustable to fit any woman's body size LIGHTWEIGHT & QUICK DRY: Compared to terry cloth robes for women it is incredibly lightweight, usually around 1.5 pound and dry 10x faster. Furthermore, it is not messy like terry robes which hold and attract dust and dirt and leave crumbles of yarn. It is so lightweight that it can be hung to dry. You can let it stay on your body while it quickly dries. It doesn't feel heavy even after it gets wet VERSATILE DESIGN & FASHION COLORS: Comfortably and proudly wear this utmost quality entire set as a sauna towel, swim cover up at beaches or pools, gym wrap, dry robe, spa towels for body, or massage wraparound. There are four color variations for your impeccable taste ONE SIZE FIT ALL: Avvexa Turkish Towel women bath wrap fit most women, adults, and teenagers. The chest stretches from 28\" to 60\" thanks to the elastic band and Velcro and mostly satisfies the need for a plus size towel wrap. Top to bottom height is 32.5\". The towel bag is very large, 17\" (width) x14\" (height). The towel turban hair wrap comfortably covers the hair it fits for 18\" - 24\" head size thanks to its 32\" long straps EASY CARE: Caring for Avvexa spa towel wrap is so easy! Simply drop your cotton women's body wrap in the washing machine on cold and low heat on the dryer. Avoid fabric softeners and dryer sheets as they might make the texture less absorbent. Avoid bleach GREAT GIFT: This towel robe for women makes a great mother's day, anniversary, bridesmaid, wedding, Christmas, or birthday gift for your wife, mom, girlfriend, daughter, holiday friends, or college girls AVVEXA GUARANTEE: We stand behind our product and offer one year warranty. Simply message us if you see any defect in one year, and we will make it right for you","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91t29doJIaL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Avvexa","source_asin":"B0BBCPKV9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBCPKV9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBCPKV9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
