window.products.push({"id":1023583,"name":"Creative Converting 16 Count Vintage Vixen 60th Birthday Beverage Napkins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pCG5XSHDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Like a fine wine, our Vintage Vixen collection celebrates the perfectly aged lady's 60th birthday. Designed beverage napkins are cocktail sized at 5\" square when folded, are a 3-ply strength and durability for no mess clean up and come 16 napkins to a package. A perfect size for finger foods, appetizers or even as coasters under your drinks, these napkins profess the guest of honor as \"perfectly aged - elegant and complex with a refined nuttiness\" and will make turning the big 6-O a big hit. She's a classic with a velvety elegance yet with a burst of good-humored fun. This ensemble captures the spirit of a woman who has it all: grace, style and a great sense of humor. You can't rush perfection, but you can make her party look perfect with coordinating tableware and decor from Creative Converting. From invitations to balloons to tablecloths, this ensemble has everything to make the celebration a one-of-a-kind event.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51pCG5XSHDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Creative Converting","source_asin":"B00BEH8FPA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BEH8FPA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BEH8FPA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
