window.products.push({"id":1023648,"name":"Waykar 296 Pint Large Commercial Dehumidifier for Basement, Industrial and Job Site Space up to 8000 Sq. Ft -Intelligent Touch Control","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":901.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jwvGvO-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE CAPACITY COMMERCIAL DEHUMIDIFIER-This industrial commercial dehumidifier can remove up 296 pints(37 Gallons) water per day, suitable to use in large area,warehouse,grow room,basement,garage,cellar,workshop, library, laboratory and small factory,etc. INTELLIGENT TOUCH CONTROL- Humidity Auto Control: Simply adjust to your ideal moisture setting, it will smartly sense room humidity and control dehumidification to maintain pre-set humidity levels. Automatic Shut Off/On: Shuts off automatically when the room humidity reachs the setting humidity and restart to working again when the humidity is above. Power Outage Auto Restart Function: It will restart automatically when power becomes available. PORTABLE DESIGN FOR LARGE SPACE- This is a portable industrial dehumidifier designed with the sleek and modern look. With four universal wheels and two ergonomically placed handles, you can move this dehumidifier easily in your area.The back housing can be opened like a door, allowing to store the drain hose and other accessories inside. CONTINUOUS DRAINAGE MODE AVAILABLE- This dehumidifier is come with a with 39.4 inches long drain hose. Easily connect with drain hose, you do not need to pour water from water bucket any more, just set your desire humidity (10-90%RH) and it will automatically turn off when it reach the point. SUPPORT: All of Waykar Dehumidifiers are covered with 30-Days Money Back if you are not satisfied with the product, 1 year warranty, 2nd year warranty extension and lifetime expert tech support. Please don't hesitate to contact us if there is any question, we will reply to you within 30 hours and help you solve the problems. Waykar customer support team is always just one-email away.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61jwvGvO-jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Waykar","source_asin":"B087C2JYJS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087C2JYJS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087C2JYJS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
