window.products.push({"id":1023664,"name":"Large Sticky Bowl by Sticky Bowl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415JWm2aymL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"The Sticky Bowl (bowl on the picture is not included) has been designed for chefs and home use, to grip mixing bowls securely down to a flat surface. It basically provides an extra hand in all types of kitchens, whether you're working on your own or with others. Sticky bowl can also be applied to plates, bowls and platters. One side has been designed bigger than the other to accommodate a larger range of bowl sizes. On the side are easy to find release levers. It is 100% Australian designed and owned. Mixing and pouring simultaneously, e.g., Cake mixes, batters etc. Emulsifying, e.g., hollandaise, mayonnaise, dressings, etc. Filling a piping bag is easy when the mixing bowl is steady. Continuous adding of ingredients while mixing. Keeps bowl steady when using hand held mixers. Stops bowls from sliding preventing accidents. Helps people with disabilities or injuries. Great for keeping items steady on boats and yachts. Directions: Place sticky bowl on any smooth surface (stainless steel, laminate, glass, granite, marble, timber, etc.). Press in centre of sticky bowl with fingers. Sit bowl in centre and press down firmly to secure. Tilt lever to release mixing bowl. Sticky bowl is dishwasher safe. Flip over to accommodate bigger bowls. Note: For textured surfaces place 'Sticky Bowl' smaller side face down for increased stability. Heat resistant, made from high quality silicone that withstands up to 250 deg. C or 550 deg. F. Commercial design, engineered to have a high tear strength and long durability. Food grade, completely food safe, made of non-porous material that does not retain odors. Diameter is about 4.5 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/415JWm2aymL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sticky Bowl","source_asin":"B013S1M84I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023664","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B013S1M84I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B013S1M84I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
