window.products.push({"id":1023763,"name":"Heavy Duty Poultry Shears | Food Grade Stainless Steel Scissors for Bone, Chicken, Meat, Fish, Seafood, Vegetables | Anti-Rust Ergonomic Spring Loaded","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QhAxcHSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKING FOOD PREPARATION EASIER - At Silver Armadillo we know how precious food preparation time can be. We bring you a versatile, heavy-duty pair of poultry scissors to make your life easier, quicker and more enjoyable in the kitchen. Whether you’re making a gourmet meal or cooking supper for the family this kitchen accessory will be your go-to helper. With wooden ergonomic handles, this culinary tool looks amazing displayed together with your knives in the kitchen. MADE TO LAST - 4CR13 Stainless Steel is extremely hard, has excellent corrosion resistance, and has high wear resistance. In other words it will last you a lifetime. This multitool is easy to clean in warm soapy water. Wipe dry with a soft cloth. NOT JUST REGULAR STAINLESS-STEEL SCISSORS - These are professional, chef standard poultry shears with extra-sharp blades and made specially to cut through thick, hard and slippery foods. Perfect for spatchcocking. They are stronger and with a better cutting force than regular shears. The blades are long with comfortable handles and spring action cutting - all of this ensures you safe and comfortable use. NOT JUST FOR POULTRY - Snip, snap and crunch with these kitchen scissors. Use in hundreds of kitchen applications such as cutting fresh herbs and leafy greens, bacon, poultry meat and cartilage, dried fruit, fish, pie dough. It works great as lobster scissors, for cutting crab claws, fresh noodles, sun dried tomatoes, broccoli and cauliflower florets, pizzas, quesadillas, pita bread and more. A WONDERFUL GIFT for the chef or foodie in your life. The perfect size for your Christmas stockings this year. Anyone who spends time in the kitchen will love it. BUY YOURS NOW and receive the BONUS BASTING BRUSH. Silver Armadillo is a well-established company with years of experience in making our customers satisfied. If for any reason you are not 100% satisfied with this purchase, feel free to call us and we will work it out with you. THIS IS A LIFETIME GUARANTEE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QhAxcHSuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silver Armadillo","source_asin":"B09R2GCQNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R2GCQNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R2GCQNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023764,"name":"Super Scrubber Duckys Version 4.0 New","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zRLeFY1RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All NEW Kit Design! 5 Scrubbers now included! 5 Scrubbers included in each kit 3 Sizes of Scrubbers - 2 Duckys, 2 Mini Eggs, 1 Micro Egg Stronger Magnets Washable Scrubbers NEW Scrubber Duckys kit includes (5) magnetic scrubbers and (1) one heavy-duty, rubber coated, magnetic outer handle. Our NEW Super Scrubber Duckys are washable and can also be cut to size to fit into smaller water pipes. To use opposite scrubbing sides, simply flip the outer magnetic handle. Watch your Duckys do backflips! Reusable! To wash your ducky and Mini/Micro eggs simply alternate rinsing your dirty duck with Scrubber Duckys \"BATH WATER\" cleaner and then under HOT tap water. Duckys are made from Natural, Scratch- free material. Ducky size: 14.5 mm Mini Egg size: 9.5 mm x 7 mm Micro Egg: 4 mm x 3mm Ducky will fit 18mm or larger & most 15mm down-tube openings Patents & Trademarks all rights reserved","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zRLeFY1RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EK ELAINE KIM","source_asin":"B0C7ZCMF1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023764","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7ZCMF1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7ZCMF1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
