window.products.push({"id":1023812,"name":"VIIMI Electric Can Opener, Portable Battery Operated Can Opener for Kitchen, Food-Safe Handheld Automatic Electric Can Opener Suitable for The Elderly","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6138PwuwqVL._AC_SL1191_.jpg","description":"Technical Specifications ?Operate voltage: DC2.4-3V ?Battery: 2xAA alkaline or rechargeable batteries(Battery Not Included) How do I open the battery compartment? Step1 - Face the back of the can opener to someone and hold the can opener with both hands Step2 - Two thumbs side by side on the back of the can opener Step3 - Slide your thumb down hard How to operate a can opener Step1 - Hold top of unit with left hand, thumb on top, fingers on the bottom and using the right hand, place thumb and index fingers on indentations of rubber grip. Step2 - Rotate rubber grip upward to access battery compartment. Lower the rubber grip and push back into original position. Step3 - Place your Mini Can Opener on top of the can with its rim positioned in the groove at the bottom of Mini Can Opener. Step4 - With the can on a flat surface, Press the Start button for about one second and release it once the Mini Can Opener starts to cut the can. After cutting, the Mini Can Opener will stop automatically. Trouble Shooting: vIf batteries are depleted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide back the Battery Door and replace 2 AA batteries. The Can Opener should continue the cutting. Remember to replace the battery. vCans with heavy seams and uneven rims may stall the Can Opener. If this happens, follow above procedure to release the can. vIf the can is get stucked, please press the white button on the top of a can opener.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6138PwuwqVL._AC_SL1191_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VIIMI","source_asin":"B08X69F733","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X69F733","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X69F733","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
