window.products.push({"id":1023869,"name":"Sunnydaze Nutcracker Ornament Set for Christmas Tree - Hanging Indoor Decorations for Holiday Decor - Vintage Style 5-Inch Wooden Soldier Figurines - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KU17ge0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Perfect size for Christmas tree or wreath: Each nutcracker Christmas decoration has a base that measures 1.25\" diameter x 0.25\" H. The overall height of the nutcracker only is 5.25\" H and the hanging loop is 3.5\" H. The ornament, including the nutcracker and the hanging loop, is 8.75\" H. Each figurine weighs 0.08 lbs. Traditional decorations: Each piece is made of wood and MDF to replicate the look of classic German nutcrackers. The nutcracker ornaments feature a vibrant painted finish to add color to your indoor space for the winter holidays. Includes 5 nutcrackers in different styles: The nutcracker ornament set consists of 1 drummer, 1 holding a peppermint drop staff, 1 holding a wreath, 1 holding a peppermint candy cane stick and 1 simply standing at attention. These decorative accents already come preassembled and ready to hang up. Ready to hang around the house each nutcracker decoration features an attached loop to hang each figurine from an indoor Christmas tree, garland, wreath, banister, hook, ceiling and other places you want to add holiday cheer. Worry-free purchasing: Sunnydaze Decor backs its products with a 1-year manufacturer's warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KU17ge0WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sunnydaze","source_asin":"B09GBNPVNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023869","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GBNPVNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GBNPVNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023870,"name":"ApolloAir Small Box Fan Wall Mount, High Velocity Powerful Air Vent Fan with In-Line Switch, Ideal for Small Window and Greenhouse, 120V AC 120mm x 38","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810qxIUCZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Optimized Airflow: This small window fan, mountable in any space, effectively maximizes airflow, making it ideal for optimal ventilation, cooling, or exhaust in any space, including kitchens and chicken coops. Energy Saving: The use of high magnetic permeability silicon steel, manufactured in Taiwan, significantly reduces the power consumption of AC cabinet fan motors, leading to increased energy efficiency and lower electricity costs. Substantial Reliability: Using AC fan motors with 100% copper winding in 4 inch fan provides durability due to their ability to produce less heat, resulting in longer-lasting and dependable performance. Extended Product Lifespan: Permanently lubricated dual-ball bearings system of our square small fans, combined with its 100% copper winding AC motor, provides long-term stability, reliability, and a lifespan exceeding 60,000 hours. Durable Structure: The greenhouse fan features a robust structure attributed to its die-cast aluminum housing, which is not only anti-rust and heavy-duty but also provides excellent heat dissipation to ensure long-term durability. In-Line Switch for Easy Control: The chicken coop fan comes with an 80 inches plug cord and an in-line switch that enables easy on/off control, making it perfect for installation in a variety of ventilated spaces, such as window and cabinet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810qxIUCZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ApolloAir","source_asin":"B08KDD2RPL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023870","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KDD2RPL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KDD2RPL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
