window.products.push({"id":1023958,"name":"BAYKA Knife Block Magnetic Knife Holder with Powerful Magnet, 100% Pure Bamboo Large Capacity Knife Organizer Block, Double Side Strongly Magnetic Kit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iKIGtzQfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Stable Triangular Base】The triangular design ensures that the knife block does not slip or sway and the knife base will not lift when knives are taken out. 【Double Sided Strong Magnets】BAYKA knife block can hold up to at least 10 knives(depending on the knife size). The magnet position is in the middle with 8 built-in black magnets. 【Safe Edge Design】For safety, BAYKA knife block reserves a non-magnetic position on both sides of the magnetic board. Therefore, avoiding the risk of scratching the hand. 【Correct Use】Knives should be placed vertically, improper placement will shift the center of gravity. Knives should only be removed vertically. 【BAYKA Warranty】Customer satisfaction is our utmost priority, we offer 30 days free return & replacement, 2 years product warranty (contact and get an extra 3 years guarantee) and lifetime customer support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iKIGtzQfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAYKA","source_asin":"B07R6QX626","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R6QX626","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R6QX626","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1023959,"name":"Nouhaus Module, Sleeper Sofa Bed Couch. 7ft Luxury Convertible Sofa Futon Bed with No Roll Together Latex. Pull Out Couch Bed for Bedroom Couch, Small","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":1060.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UV4OTRGmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With a futon sofa bed there’s no more fighting with space. But with a Nouhaus ‘Module’ Pull Out Bed there’s no more fighting discomfort or settling on design, because we took the popular and comfy mid-century living room couch and merged it with a proper mattress that feels as good as it looks. Breathable, Supportive Latex Mattress: No more unforgiving foam, hard cross bars and squeaky springs. Because The Module folding couch is “Sofa by Day, Best Sleep Ever by Night”. It conforms without swallowing your body, supports like a hug, lets you sleep on the edge and blocks roll together! Why can’t you have a luxury sofa bed in your tiny home, apartment, RV, office or bedroom too? Let other people settle for unforgiving futons or a short loveseat sofa, because this 86” x 37 to 56” (sofa to bed) sleeper fits most compact spaces. Measure up your space now and see how it fits yours. Forget about complicated set ups, and hardware that grabs your fingers because the Nouhaus Module will turn into a bed in 3-steps. And one of those steps is throwing the cushions off, that’s how easy it is. When yours arrives, attach the legs (instructions included) to make it a sofa. And lounge back in style. While you’ve definitely seen this modern sofa before, this is the first time you’ve seen it in such a versatile sleeper couch design! Available in your choice of color and fabric, so take a look at the range, and see which Module matches your vibe best. Become a fancier couch potato, with Nouhaus","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UV4OTRGmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nouhaus","source_asin":"B092VG8YQ9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1023959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092VG8YQ9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092VG8YQ9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
